<title>USA: Atlantic Beverage Co Inc Q1 shr shrinks.</title>
<headline>Atlantic Beverage Co Inc Q1 shr shrinks.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.03		    $0.08</p>
<p> Net			    169			223</p>
<p> Sales		     41,401		   34,215</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   6,656		    2,950</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q1 1996 net includes one-time settlement gain of $250,000, or $0.08 per share, from a former supplier. Excluding the gain, Q1 1996 would have posted a loss of $26,645, or $0.00 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
